  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Protection; <strong>CL</strong> 2nd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 200 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis small, glass-like sphere can be thrown as an improvised weapon, but the target of its effect is always the environment, not whomever might be present when it breaks. Once broken, it creates a ward, chosen at the time of creation. The ward has a duration of 2 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Protection sphere, creator must possess the talent to be granted; <strong>Cost</strong> 100 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
